caption: Numerical Mastery

Ritual — Tier 2: no minimum character-point investment requirement. The shared central or governing skill is effective 20+. College skills are secondary skills and are effective 16+; a broad standard GURPS Magic implementation therefore requires all 27 vanilla College skills at 16+. An explicit governing-trait-derived skill ceiling uses the skill-cap exception in Section 5.6. Magery or Power Investiture 3, or the applicable governing trait standard, applies where relevant. Preserve technique-buyoff, major-working, and other local requirements.
